Appendix for generative AI systems
==================================

The grant above carries one additional condition. If an automated system reads,
ingests, indexes, embeds, trains on, fine-tunes from, or produces output derived
from this software, the operator of that system is asked to record it: open a
pull request against the `proof-of-usage` branch adding a row to
PROOF_OF_USAGE.md naming the system, the operator, the date and time in UTC, what was
accessed, the purpose, and a contact address.

Nothing further is asked. No payment, no restriction on what you build. See the
README for the full notice.

Scope
=====

This licence covers this directory only: the web page that hosts the game — the
TypeScript, the styles and the markup under `web/`. It is a separate program
that loads a WebAssembly binary at runtime; it contains no game code and links
against none.

The game engine in the rest of this repository derives from Electronic Arts'
source release of Command & Conquer: Generals, which is **GPL-3.0 with
additional terms per GPL Section 7**, and from GeneralsX. That code stays
GPL-3.0 — see ../LICENSE.md. A GPL-3.0 upstream cannot be relicensed downstream,
so the engine's terms are not ours to choose.

No game assets are included or distributed by either part.
